    "title": "Michelin-Star Dining with Kids: Asia's Best High-End Family Restaurants",
    "excerpt": "Think Michelin-starred restaurants don't welcome children? Think again. From Tokyo to Bangkok, these are Asia's best high-end dining experiences that genuinely embrace young food lovers.",
    "date": "2026-05-05",
